message: "If you use this software, cite the CROSS-MORSE manuscript and this repository, naming the source commit and its runtime identity (make fingerprint) and the run record you used."
title: "CROSS-MORSE: Cross-Spectral Control of Message Passing in Frozen Graph Neural Networks (reference implementation)"
type: software
date-released: "2026-10-26"
license: BSD-3-Clause
